<title>UK: Portman B/S sets 150 mln stg three-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Portman B/S sets 150 mln stg three-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager NatWest Markets.</p>
<p> BORROWER   PORTMAN BUILDING SOCIETY</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN STG   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 DEC.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     8 BP	PAY DATE    10.DEC.96</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   ISS PRICE  99.909    FULL FEES   6 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    2.5 BP    SELL CONC  3.5 BP    PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
